# L §5.10 The sign rule (round 16): checked "1. after the day's first batch, taken together: its readings at the start,
# its observations ... and its plans (so an amount that arises and is paid on one day nets inside it)"; "A balance that
# breaks the rule at one of these points is refused from there (RUN-PLACE), with the legs at the place that brought it
# there: the batch's"; L §8.4 `<place> is <b> after the day's observations and plans of <d>`. owed is a debt (max 0):
# on 2026-03-10 a_repay pays 100.00 PLN into it and b_borrow takes 100.00 PLN out, which net to 0 whatever their
# order: no refusal (q). With c_over paying 1.00 PLN more (q2) the batch leaves owed at 1.00 PLN: refused, and so are
# the batch's legs at owed (flows of a_repay and c_over; E §4.2 step 5).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place owed: debts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input day: date
input big: money PLN

move a_repay: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from konto to owed amount amt

move b_borrow: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from owed to konto amount amt

move c_over: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from konto to owed amount big

ask q: bal(owed, 2026-03-31), bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask q2: bal(owed, 2026-03-31), flows(a_repay, 2026-03), flows(c_over, 2026-03) with big = 1.00 PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN
  big = 0.00 PLN
  day = 2026-03-10
  opening[owed] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
=== expect
q: (0.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN)
  unfulfilled: a_repay
  unfulfilled: b_borrow
  cut 2026-06-30
q2: (refused: RUN-PLACE owed is 1.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-10, refused: RUN-PLACE owed is 1.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-10, refused: RUN-PLACE owed is 1.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-10)
  pinned: big = 1.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: a_repay
  unfulfilled: c_over
  cut 2026-06-30
